{"id":"n60822-3-7","stage":4,"title":"빚어지다 · 酿成","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60822-3-7-1","ko":"이 술은 집에서 빚어진 게 아닌 거 같은데.","zh":"这酒看起来不是家里自己酿的吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"술은","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"술은","audio":"/audio/7918286aa052e0618acc.mp3"}},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에서","audio":"/audio/c00afeb6cadab90f0098.mp3"}},{"text":"빚어진","meaning":"酿成","explanation":"빚어지다：酿成；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"빚어지다","audio":"/audio/90aeea56750be398b37d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60822","senseId":"3","lemma":"빚어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빚어진","audio":"/audio/f9c6bd6afce8bc3dbbf8.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"事物（것 + 主格助词 이）","explanation":"게 是依存名词 것 和主格助词 이 的缩合，指前面修饰的事物、行为或情况，并把它作为主语；这里不是表示将来计划的 -ㄹ/을 것이다。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"아닌","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"아닌","audio":"/audio/abf14847af50c8c65e3b.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아닌","audio":"/audio/abf14847af50c8c65e3b.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"2","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데","audio":"/audio/09d1b4825a769d691604.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"90aeea56750be398","term":"빚어지다","zh":"酿成","audio":"/audio/90aeea56750be398b37d.mp3","entryId":"60822","definition":"酒被制成。","pronunciation":["비저지다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"事物、事情","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"事物、事情","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7914b30ccf42cdb04622.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60822-3-7-2","ko":"가게에서 산 거야.","zh":"是在店里买的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가게에서","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가게에서","audio":"/audio/b0c1b40c97480a29b4b2.mp3"}},{"text":"산","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/6b20767c10a875229eb8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.636,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60822","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":131,"sequenceScore":2.4627,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这酒看起来不是家里自己酿的吧。","是在店里买的。","就算你再怎么劝我别做，我还是要做的。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这酒看起来不是家里自己酿的吧。","是在店里买的。","就算你再怎么劝我别做，我还是要做的。"],"answer":1}]}
